{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54422","headline":"暮春即事和顾云友使 · 崔致远","name":"暮春即事和顾云友使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东风遍阅百般香，意绪偏饶柳带长。\n苏武书回深塞尽，庄周梦逐落花忙。\n好凭残景朝朝醉，难把离心寸寸量。\n正是浴沂时节日，旧游魂断白云乡。\n（以上五首录自《社会科学战线》一九八四年第四期刊何鸣雁《新罗诗人崔致远》一文）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54422.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54422","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}